                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does it cost to launch a D2C kids wear brand in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Minimum viable: Rs 20-40 lakh (2-3 SKU collections, marketplace-first). Serious market entry: Rs 40 lakh-Rs 1.5 Cr (15-40 SKU + certifications + parent-focused marketing 6-12 months). Premium heritage / occasion launch: Rs 1.5-5 Cr+.</p>
                                        <h3>Which certifications are essential for kids wear brands in India?</h3>
                                        <p>BIS mandatory (India domestic). OEKO-TEX Standard 100 (safety - increasingly expected by consumers + retailers). GOTS (organic). Fair Trade / Fair Wear (ethical labour). CPSIA (USA export) + EN71 (EU export) for international.</p>
                                        <h3>Which marketplace is best for a new D2C kids wear brand in India?</h3>
